('wikiloc', '223650241', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/spain-candan-223650241', 'Spain - Candan', '{"en":"Long one-way from Zobra","ca":"Un sol sentit llarg des de Zobra","es":"Un solo sentido largo desde Zobra"}'::jsonb, 'Spain - Candan Hiking trail in Zobra, Galicia (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Spain - Candan
It''s 18 km', '{"en":"This challenging one-way route in Candán, Galicia, covers 27.1 km with a significant elevation gain of 968 m. It''s suitable for experienced hikers looking for a long, demanding day out in the Galician mountains.\n\nThe trail navigates varied terrain, requiring good physical condition and stamina. Hikers should be prepared for a full day of walking, potentially encountering remote sections.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta lineal a Candán, Galícia, recorre 27.1 km amb un desnivell acumulat considerable de 968 m. És adequada per a excursionistes experimentats que busquen una jornada llarga i exigent a les muntanyes gallegues.\n\nEl sender travessa terrenys variats, requerint una bona condició física i resistència. Els excursionistes han d''estar preparats per a un dia complet de caminada, podent trobar trams remots.","es":"Esta exigente ruta lineal en Candán, Galicia, cubre 27.1 km con un desnivel acumulado considerable de 968 m. Es adecuada para excursionistas experimentados que buscan una jornada larga y exigente en las montañas gallegas.\n\nEl sendero atraviesa terrenos variados, requiriendo una buena condición física y resistencia. Los excursionistas deben estar preparados para un día completo de caminata, pudiendo encontrar tramos remotos."}'::jsonb, 'Joanna7070', 27053, 968, 1154, 1022, 420, 'difficult', 'one-way', 20580, 26280, 1987, '2025-07-25', '2025-06', '[{"lat":42.58566,"lng":-8.243312,"ele":674.8},{"lat":42.585664,"lng":-8.243374,"ele":675.8},{"lat":42.585665,"lng":-8.243436,"ele":676.2},{"lat":42.585656,"lng":-8.243503,"ele":676.6},{"lat":42.58566,"lng":-8.243571,"ele":679.1},{"lat":42.585655,"lng":-8.243638,"ele":679.3},{"lat":42.585647,"lng":-8.243704,"ele":678.1},{"lat":42.585641,"lng":-8.243766,"ele":679.1},{"lat":42.585597,"lng":-8.243938,"ele":679.7},{"lat":42.585552,"lng":-8.243959,"ele":680.4},{"lat":42.585517,"lng":-8.244003,"ele":688.3},{"lat":42.585494,"lng":-8.244061,"ele":688.6},{"lat":42.58546,"lng":-8.244122,"ele":687.2}