Síguenos en facebook en ADN Astur,con más fotos,vídeos y crónicas.', '{"en":"This moderate 15.8 km loop ascends Pico Mostayal, starting from the Xanas recreational area (190m) with parking. The route begins with a climb through the Xanas Gorge, a scenic path with tunnels and some handrails, leading to the chapel of Pedroveya (550m) and then the village of Pedroveya (560m).\n\nFrom Pedroveya, the trail continues on tracks and paths, with some short sections of trails, towards the summit. The technical difficulty is easy, but the distance and elevation gain make it a moderate outing. The ascent to the peak can involve snow in winter conditions. The descent follows the Valdolayés Trail.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 15.8 km puja al Pico Mostayal, començant des de l''àrea recreativa de les Xanas (190m) amb aparcament. La ruta s''inicia amb una pujada pel Desfiladero de las Xanas, un camí escènic amb túnels i alguns passamans, que porta a la capella de Pedroveya (550m) i després al poble de Pedroveya (560m).\n\nDes de Pedroveya, el sender continua per pistes i camins, amb alguns trams curts de senders, cap al cim. La dificultat tècnica és fàcil, però la distància i el desnivell la converteixen en una sortida moderada. L''ascens al cim pot implicar neu en condicions hivernals. El descens segueix la Senda de Valdolayés.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 15.8 km asciende al Pico Mostayal, comenzando desde el área recreativa de las Xanas (190m) con aparcamiento. La ruta se inicia con una subida por el Desfiladero de las Xanas, un camino escénico con túneles y algunos pasamanos, que lleva a la capilla de Pedroveya (550m) y luego al pueblo de Pedroveya (560m).\n\nDesde Pedroveya, el sendero continúa por pistas y caminos, con algunos tramos cortos de senderos, hacia la cumbre. La dificultad técnica es fácil, pero la distancia y el desnivel la convierten en una salida moderada. El ascenso a la cima puede implicar nieve en condiciones invernales. El descenso sigue la Senda de Valdolayés."}'::jsonb, 'ADN Astur - Guías de Montaña y BTT', 15804, 1236, 1236, 1291, 178, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, NULL, 2127, '2012-02-12', '2012-01', '[{"lat":43.274425,"lng":-5.994207,"ele":178.5},{"lat":43.274448,"lng":-5.994163,"ele":179},{"lat":43.274504,"lng":-5.994061,"ele":180},{"lat":43.274514,"lng":-5.994014,"ele":180.6},{"lat":43.27452,"lng":-5.993996,"ele":180.8},{"lat":43.274553,"lng":-5.993879,"ele":182.5},{"lat":43.274631,"lng":-5.993829,"ele":183.5},{"lat":43.27464,"lng":-5.993818,"ele":183.8},{"lat":43.274736,"lng":-5.993736,"ele":185.8},{"lat":43.274777,"lng":-5.993636,"ele":188.4},{"lat":43.274781,"lng":-5.993618,"ele":188.9},{"lat":43.274754,"lng":-5.993519,"ele":193.5},{"lat":43.274861,"lng":-5.993411,"ele":196.6},{"lat":43.274868,"lng":-5.993407,"ele":196.7},{"lat":43.27494,"lng":-5.993325,"ele":199.3},{"lat":43.274982,"lng":-5.993286,"ele":200.7},{"lat":43.27503,"lng":-5.993224,"ele":203.2},{"lat":43.275054,"lng":-5.993206,"ele":203.8},{"lat":43.275164,"lng":-5.99308,"ele":206.5},{"lat":43.275189,"lng":-5.993056,"ele":206.5},{"lat":43.275227,"lng":-5.992997,"ele":208.3},{"lat":43.275353,"lng":-5.99281,"ele":212.9},{"lat":43.27536,"lng":-5.992799,"ele":213.2},{"lat":43.27544,"lng":-5.992721,"ele":214},{"lat":43.275548,"lng":-5.992589,"ele":215.5},{"lat":43.275587,"lng":-5.992564,"ele":215.4},{"lat":43.275621,"lng":-5.992509,"ele":217},{"lat":43.275674,"lng":-5.992439,"ele":218.9},{"lat":43.275706,"lng":-5.992356,"ele":221.5},{"lat":43.275808,"lng":-5.992221,"ele":222.4},{"lat":43.275853,"lng":-5.992155,"ele":224.4},{"lat":43.275922,"lng":-5.992055,"ele":227.1},{"lat":43.275992,"lng":-5.991964,"ele":227.5},{"lat":43.276014,"lng":-5.991909,"ele":228.5},{"lat":43.276029,"lng":-5.991873,"ele":229.1},{"lat":43.276089,"lng":-5.991749,"ele":230.8},{"lat":43.276107,"lng":-5.991723,"ele":230.8},{"lat":43.27615,"lng":-5.991594,"ele":233.8},{"lat":43.276221,"lng":-5.991459,"ele":234},{"lat":43.276271,"lng":-5.991342,"ele":234},{"lat":43.276