https://amsenderismo.blogspot.com/2026/05/ruta-303-ascenso-al-ecce-homo-fortaleza.html', '{"en":"This moderate 12.5 km loop explores the Parque de Los Cerros de Alcalá, starting from Alcalá de Henares. The route ascends to Cerro del Ecce Homo, also known as Pico de la Vera Cruz, which offers extensive views of Alcalá, the countryside, and the Henares corridor. The terrain is characterized by gypsum, clay, and marl materials shaped by erosion.\n\nThe trail also visits the ruins of the Fortaleza de Alcalá la Vieja, follows sections along the Henares River, and explores various ravines and caves within the park. This route is part of the official yellow trail of the park, providing a comprehensive tour of its natural and historical landmarks.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 12,5 km explora el Parc de Los Cerros de Alcalá, començant des d''Alcalá de Henares. La ruta ascendeix al Cerro del Ecce Homo, també conegut com a Pico de la Vera Cruz, que ofereix àmplies vistes d''Alcalá, la campiña i bona part del corredor de l''Henares. El terreny es caracteritza per materials guixencs, argiles i margues modelats per l''erosió.\n\nEl sender també visita les ruïnes de la Fortaleza de Alcalá la Vieja, segueix trams al llarg del riu Henares i explora diversos barrancs i coves dins del parc. Aquesta ruta forma part del sender groc oficial del parc, oferint un recorregut complet pels seus punts d''interès naturals i històrics.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 12,5 km explora el Parque de Los Cerros de Alcalá, comenzando desde Alcalá de Henares. La ruta asciende al Cerro del Ecce Homo, también conocido como Pico de la Vera Cruz, que ofrece amplias vistas de Alcalá, la campiña y buena parte del corredor del Henares. El terreno se caracteriza por materiales yesíferos, arcillas y margas modelados por la erosión.\n\nEl sendero también visita las ruinas de la Fortaleza de Alcalá la Vieja, sigue tramos a lo largo del río Henares y explora diversos barrancos y cuevas dentro del parque. Esta ruta forma parte del sendero amarillo oficial del parque, ofreciendo un recorrido completo por sus puntos de interés naturales e históricos."}'::jsonb, 'AM Senderismo', 12505, 322, 322, 830, 587, 'moderate', 'loop', 14280, 17100, 2214, '2026-05-08', '2026-04', '[{"lat":40.46324,"lng":-3.359756,"ele":598.8},{"lat":40.463289,"lng":-3.359729,"ele":598.5},{"lat":40.463291,"lng":-3.35966,"ele":598.8},{"lat":40.463333,"lng":-3.359638,"ele":598.3},{"lat":40.463376,"lng":-3.359657,"ele":597.7},{"lat":40.463341,"lng":-3.359615,"ele":598.3},{"lat":40.4633,"lng":-3.359576,"ele":599.1},{"lat":40.463338,"lng":-3.359528,"ele":598.6},{"lat":40.463363,"lng":-3.359476,"ele":598.5},{"lat":40.463391,"lng":-3.359429,"ele":598.2},{"lat":40.463414,"lng":-3.359378,"ele":598},{"lat":40.463416,"lng":-3.359314,"ele":598.1},{"lat":40.463421,"lng":-3.359251,"ele":598.2},{"lat":40.463446,"lng":-3.359197,"ele":597.9},{"lat":40.463442,"lng":-3.359138,"ele":598},{"lat":40.463446,"lng":-3.359078,"ele":598},{"lat":40.463452,"lng":-3.359003,"ele":597.9},{"lat":40.463464,"lng":-3.358944,"ele":597.6},{"lat":40.463468,"lng":-3.358881,"ele":597.6},{"lat":40.463479,"lng":-3.358821,"ele":597.5},{"lat":40.463491,"lng":-3.358763,"ele":597.4},{"lat":40.4635,"lng":-3.358695,"ele":597.4},{"lat":40.463509,"lng":-3.358636,"ele":597.4},{"lat":40.463524,"lng":-3.358572,"ele":597.4},{"lat":40.463523,"lng":-3.358508,"ele":597.6},{"lat":40.46353,"lng":-3.358435,"ele":597.8},{"lat":40.463544,"lng":-3.358374,"ele":597.8},{"lat":40.463547,"lng":-3.358305,"ele":598},{"lat":40.463554,"lng":-3.358233,"ele":598},{"lat":40.463558,"lng":-3.358165,"ele":598.1},{"lat":40.463566,"lng":-3.358098,"ele":598.2},{"lat":40.463564,"lng":-3.358037,"ele":598.4},{"lat":40.46353,"lng":-3.357981,"ele":598.7},{"lat":40.463492,"lng":-3.35794,"ele":598.9},{"lat":40.463452,"lng":-3.357901,"ele":599.1},{"lat":40.463407,"lng":-3.357863,"ele":599.1},{"lat":40.46337,"lng":-3.357827,"ele":599.1},{"lat":40.463328,"lng":-3.357795,"ele":59