Rutas de senderismo por la Sierra de Queixa', '{"en":"This easy-to-moderate loop trail starts from the Cabeza de Manzaneda Winter Resort, specifically near the \"Galicia\" apartments. The route combines forest tracks, narrow paths, cattle trails, and some off-trail sections.\n\nThe hike leads to A Lagoa Pequena, then passes Os Callostros de Prada, a viewpoint offering expansive vistas. It continues over Cerro 1573 m before ascending to the main summit.\n\nThe trail culminates at Cabeza Grande (1781 m), the highest point. Covering 8.8 km with 322 m of elevation gain, this route is suitable for most hikers, with a marked water source available along the way.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular de dificultat baixa-moderada comença a l''Estació Invernal de Cabeza de Manzaneda, concretament prop dels apartaments \"Galicia\". El recorregut combina pistes forestals, senders estrets, camins de bestiar i algunes seccions camp a través.\n\nLa caminada porta a A Lagoa Pequena, passa per Os Callostros de Prada, un mirador amb vistes extenses. Continua per Cerro 1573 m abans d''ascendir al cim principal.\n\nEl sender culmina a Cabeza Grande (1781 m), el punt més alt. Amb 8,8 km i 322 m de desnivell positiu, aquesta ruta és apta per a la majoria d''excursionistes, amb una font d''aigua marcada disponible al llarg del camí.","es":"Esta ruta circular de dificultad baja-moderada comienza en la Estación Invernal de Cabeza de Manzaneda, específicamente cerca de los apartamentos \"Galicia\". El recorrido combina pistas forestales, senderos estrechos, trochas de ganado y algunas secciones campo a través.\n\nLa caminata lleva a A Lagoa Pequena, luego pasa por Os Callostros de Prada, un mirador que ofrece vistas amplias. Continúa sobre el Cerro 1573 m antes de ascender a la cumbre principal.\n\nEl sendero culmina en Cabeza Grande (1781 m), el punto más alto. Con 8,8 km y 322 m de desnivel positivo, esta ruta es adecuada para la mayoría de los excursionistas, con una fuente de agua marcada disponible a lo largo del camino."}'::jsonb, 'Montaña y Corazón', 8787, 322, 322, 1781, 1482, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 8520, 752, '2018-08-07', '2018-07', '[{"lat":42.273605,"lng":-7.290535,"ele":1482.2},{"lat":42.273608,"lng":-7.290534,"ele":1483},{"lat":42.273573,"lng":-7.29062,"ele":1483},{"lat":42.273555,"lng":-7.29076,"ele":1483.6},{"lat":42.273681,"lng":-7.29101,"ele":1484.2},{"lat":42.273681,"lng":-7.29116,"ele":1485.4},{"lat":42.273641,"lng":-7.291233,"ele":1485.4},{"lat":42.273535,"lng":-7.291371,"ele":1485.6},{"lat":42.273482,"lng":-7.291503,"ele":1485.8},{"lat":42.273461,"lng":-7.291527,"ele":1486},{"lat":42.273392,"lng":-7.291581,"ele":1486},{"lat":42.273281,"lng":-7.291789,"ele":1487},{"lat":42.273257,"lng":-7.291898,"ele":1488},{"lat":42.273203,"lng":-7.291967,"ele":1487},{"lat":42.27313,"lng":-7.292027,"ele":1486.6},{"lat":42.272455,"lng":-7.29215,"ele":1490.2},{"lat":42.272842,"lng":-7.292392,"ele":1490.2},{"lat":42.272817,"lng":-7.292383,"ele":1501.2},{"lat":42.272809,"lng":-7.292377,"ele":1501.2},{"lat":42.272741,"lng":-7.292346,"ele":1502.2},{"lat":42.272561,"lng":-7.292371,"ele":1503.8},{"lat":42.272443,"lng":-7.292438,"ele":1504.8},{"lat":42.272404,"lng":-7.292461,"ele":1505.4},{"lat":42.272293,"lng":-7.292509,"ele":1506.6},{"lat":42.272177,"lng":-7.292628,"ele":1508.6},{"lat":42.272139,"lng":-7.292677,"ele":1509.6},{"lat":42.272087,"lng":-7.292829,"ele":1511.6},{"lat":42.272081,"lng":-7.292852,"ele":1512},{"lat":42.272065,"lng":-7.292877,"ele":1512.4},{"lat":42.272029,"lng":-7.292907,"ele":1512.6},{"lat":42.271904,"lng":-7.292951,"ele":1513.4},{"lat":42.271758,"lng":-7.293001,"ele":1514.4},{"lat":42.271574,"lng":-7.292966,"ele":1515},{"lat":42.271326,"lng":-7.293005,"ele":1515.2},{"lat":42.271185,"lng":-7.293003,"ele":1515.6},{"lat":42.271054,"lng":-7.29301,"ele":1515.4},{"lat":42.270829,"lng":-7.292682,"ele":1516},{"lat":42.27084,"lng":-7.292407,"ele":1516.4},{"lat":42.270851,"lng":-7.292293,"ele":1516.2},{"lat":42.270848,"lng":-7.29211,"ele":1516.4},{