('wikiloc', '33190727', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/aian-o-val-a-monte-farelo-bajada-a-cova-do-farelo-y-vuela-a-la-aldea-aian-33190727', 'Aian, or Val, Mount Farelo, Descent to Cova do Farelo and Return to Aian Village', '{"en":"Aian village loop with Cova do Farelo","ca":"Circular Aian amb Cova do Farelo","es":"Circular Aian con Cova do Farelo"}'::jsonb, 'Aian, o Val , a monte farelo, bajada a cova do Farelo y vuela a la aldea Aian Hiking trail in Trabancas, Galicia (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Circular saliendo de la explanada exterior donde esta el cruceiro de Aian , atravesando está hacia la aldea do Val, subida con un desnivel de 500 metros al monte Farelo, desde su mirador y geodésico, se pueden observar importantes ayuntamientos de las cuatro provincias gallegas, bajada a Cova do Farelo y de vuelta a Aian. Buenos y limpios caminos e encontrado para realizar la ruta . Esta zona pertenece A Golada, para completar bajamos a la misma a visitar los pendellos.', '{"en":"This moderate 8.9 km loop with 377 m of elevation gain starts from the esplanade with the cruceiro in Aian. The route crosses the village towards Val before a steady 500-meter climb to Monte Farelo.\n\nFrom the summit''s viewpoint and geodetic vertex, hikers can observe various municipalities across the four Galician provinces. The descent leads to Cova do Farelo before returning to Aian, utilizing well-maintained paths throughout the route.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 8,9 km amb 377 m de desnivell positiu comença des de l''esplanada amb el cruceiro a Aian. El recorregut travessa el poble cap a Val abans d''una pujada constant de 500 metres fins al Monte Farelo.\n\nDes del mirador i el vèrtex geodèsic del cim, els excursionistes poden observar diversos municipis de les quatre províncies gallegues. La baixada condueix a la Cova do Farelo abans de tornar a Aian, utilitzant camins ben mantinguts durant tota la ruta.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 8,9 km con 377 m de desnivel positivo comienza desde la explanada con el cruceiro en Aian. El recorrido atraviesa el pueblo hacia Val antes de una subida constante de 500 metros hasta el Monte Farelo.\n\nDesde el mirador y el vértice geodésico de la cima, los excursionistas pueden observar varios municipios de las cuatro provincias gallegas. El descenso conduce a la Cova do Farelo antes de regresar a Aian, utilizando caminos bien mantenidos durante toda la ruta."}'::jsonb, 'joseramonjaneiro59', 8932, 377, 377, 953, 578, 'moderate', 'loop', 9060, 13500, 1585, '2019-02-15', '2019-01', '[{"lat":42.755397,"lng":-7.977417,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.755428,"lng":-7.977369,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.755454,"lng":-7.977314,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.755499,"lng":-7.977302,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.755548,"lng":-7.977289,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.755596,"lng":-7.977289,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.755641,"lng":-7.977299,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.755688,"lng":-7.977302,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.755734,"lng":-7.977289,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.75578,"lng":-7.977291,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.755828,"lng":-7.977286,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.75588,"lng":-7.977282,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.755925,"lng":-7.977272,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.75597,"lng":-7.977258,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.756015,"lng":-7.977231,"ele":588.1},{"lat":42.756046,"lng":-7.97717,"ele":588.5},{"lat":42.756064,"lng":-7.977106,"ele":588.6},{"lat":42.756094,"lng":-7.977061,"ele":588.8},{"lat":42.756131,"lng":-7.977018,"ele":588.6},{"lat":42.756175,"lng":-7.97699,"ele":588.5},{"lat":42.756216,"lng":-7.976961,"ele":588.4},{"lat":42.75626,"lng":-7.976925,"ele":588.7},{"lat":42.756305,"lng":-7.976885,"ele":588.6},{"lat":42.756352,"lng":-7.976854,"ele":588.9},{"lat":42.756396,"lng":-7.976831,"ele":588.5},{"lat":42.756442,"lng":-7.97679,"ele":589},{"lat":42.756481,"lng":-7.976751,"ele":588.7},{"lat":42.756522,"lng":-7.976718,"ele":588.9},{"lat":42.756571,"lng":-7.976678,"ele":588.5},{"lat":42.756624,"lng":-7.976669,"ele":588.4},{"lat":42.756677,"lng":