('wikiloc', '39512799', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/torre-bermeja-por-pambuches-y-vuelta-por-la-travesona-39512799', 'Torre Bermeja via Pambuches and Return via La Travesona', '{"en":"Circular via Pambuches and La Travesona","ca":"Circular per Pambuches i La Travesona","es":"Circular por Pambuches y La Travesona"}'::jsonb, 'Torre Bermeja por Pambuches y vuelta por La Travesona Hiking trail in Posada de Valdeón, Castilla y León (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Posada de Valdeón - Canal de Pambuches - Collada de Pambuches - La Gatera - Torre Bermeja - Collada Verde - La Travesona - Vega de Llos - Posada de Valdeón', '{"en":"This 16.6 km loop route to Torre Bermeja (2400m) starts and ends in Posada de Valdeón. The ascent follows the Canal de Pambuches to Collada de Pambuches and La Gatera before reaching the summit.\n\nThe return journey descends via Collada Verde and La Travesona, passing through Vega de Llos. This route offers a varied terrain experience, combining steep canal ascents with a different return path.\n\nWith a significant elevation gain of 1631m, this is a long and demanding day out, suitable for hikers with good physical condition and experience in mountain environments.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular de 16.6 km a Torre Bermeja (2400m) comença i acaba a Posada de Valdeón. L''ascens segueix la Canal de Pambuches fins a la Collada de Pambuches i La Gatera abans d''arribar al cim.\n\nEl retorn descendeix per la Collada Verde i La Travesona, passant per Vega de Llos. Aquesta ruta ofereix una experiència de terreny variada, combinant ascensos per canals pronunciades amb un camí de retorn diferent.\n\nAmb un desnivell positiu significatiu de 1631m, aquesta és una jornada llarga i exigent, apta per a excursionistes amb bona condició física i experiència en entorns de muntanya.","es":"Esta ruta circular de 16.6 km a Torre Bermeja (2400m) comienza y termina en Posada de Valdeón. El ascenso sigue el Canal de Pambuches hasta la Collada de Pambuches y La Gatera antes de alcanzar la cumbre.\n\nEl camino de regreso desciende por Collada Verde y La Travesona, pasando por Vega de Llos. Esta ruta ofrece una experiencia de terreno variada, combinando ascensos por canales pronunciadas con un camino de retorno diferente.\n\nCon un desnivel positivo significativo de 1631m, esta es una jornada larga y exigente, adecuada para excursionistas con buena condición física y experiencia en entornos de montaña."}'::jsonb, 'Enrique Gonber', 16592, 1631, 1631, 2442, 960, 'easy', 'loop', 19800, 30960, 4604, '2019-08-03', '2019-07', '[{"lat":43.151082,"lng":-4.918327,"ele":974.9},{"lat":43.151136,"lng":-4.918322,"ele":974.9},{"lat":43.151192,"lng":-4.918329,"ele":974.9},{"lat":43.151201,"lng":-4.918404,"ele":974.9},{"lat":43.151207,"lng":-4.918473,"ele":974.9},{"lat":43.151284,"lng":-4.918468,"ele":974.9},{"lat":43.1514,"lng":-4.918574,"ele":974.9},{"lat":43.151458,"lng":-4.918583,"ele":974.6},{"lat":43.151516,"lng":-4.91865,"ele":971.9},{"lat":43.151632,"lng":-4.918905,"ele":977.7},{"lat":43.151793,"lng":-4.919035,"ele":976.4},{"lat":43.151836,"lng":-4.919075,"ele":976.7},{"lat":43.15189,"lng":-4.919106,"ele":976.1},{"lat":43.151946,"lng":-4.919137,"ele":976.5},{"lat":43.152007,"lng":-4.919173,"ele":971.4},{"lat":43.152106,"lng":-4.919246,"ele":971.4},{"lat":43.152161,"lng":-4.919268,"ele":972.1},{"lat":43.152204,"lng":-4.919286,"ele":972.1},{"lat":43.152266,"lng":-4.919331,"ele":970.9},{"lat":43.15232,"lng":-4.919369,"ele":968.1},{"lat":43.152389,"lng":-4.919425,"ele":966},{"lat":43.152432,"lng":-4.91951,"ele":969.1},{"lat":43.152454,"lng":-4.919571,"ele":969.9},{"lat":43.152469,"lng":-4.919643,"ele":969.2},{"lat":43.152479,"lng":-4.919708,"ele":969.6},{"lat":43.152471,"lng":-4.919806,"ele":969.6},{"lat":43.152464,"lng":-4.919907,"ele":968.7},{"lat":43.152454,"lng":-4.919983,"ele":968.9},{"lat":43.152451,"lng":-4.920046,"ele":970.2},{"lat":43.152443,"lng":-4.92011,"ele":969.8},{"lat":43.152422,"lng":-